{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_012_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0cf74538b451f5205d8b3ce7342fc09ba557e42445d260340e4906d3123350b5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e63230530971f3fee436066b7e7142a4a176f56251347447e2d32f16b1bd188",
      "text": "等你好久啦！\n●●●●●●●●●●监督，巧克力多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63e3a2765b2048eabcbbd51a1558517cd5e8819c3fc19b099e6ba40b4470a5fd",
      "text": "我今年也超级期待能不能\n从监督那里收到巧克力呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2c3420df73216ef60dcc135f634a041312ce8e509c0c25f0cbbbf771a9a71b8",
      "text": "你能喜欢，比什么都好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199bb7d3c7acfe819df7faa019c4185f04c4879d604d799703f653816631f95b",
      "text": "嘿嘿。既然是监督特意为我准备的\n巧克力，我肯定会超级高兴的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60da05600d92ae8c6a95824df4c735773c0187265577370d06639b74c7b7403b",
      "text": "说起来，去年在到家之前，\n就全部被我吃光了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5e96e77c5e00af6c63611d9f5881b4a109e80b09dd4b91c74a7f96df42240c",
      "text": "明明想着一口气吃完太可惜了，\n可一开始吃就停不下来了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8281a29be4f1432e4574ecb37420d0eab65f03ec2bfb83b428972c0e9b98a0a7",
      "text": "不过，今年我一定会好好带回家去吃的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000050:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc387f3debfe9dc431062ff4f47a08e7bf702f3570a91184a73767360d3c721",
      "text": "请按照你喜欢的节奏享用吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93e91913aa8560c9ebf965cd7922deb8d8842c3a487410dfcc4bd9632e42b4c1",
      "text": "只要你能吃得开心，什么时候吃我都高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e27c8d6bcf195ccfe215fc17d8e499f6ce08de428f7b0697bc15350f839dd7",
      "text": "被、被你这么一说，我现在就有点想吃了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_012_23:5_01_012_23_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e5ebae475ca61a1f77e19e88c9e124571a17e3a59282fcaf77d4c5eb9f3faa",
      "text": "不行不行，难得是监督送给我的！\n今年我一定要慢慢品尝着吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
